Aerie-Purpose: Test builds only: build the Workspace helper and register chrome://workspace-test (enabled by --aerie-test-workspaces).
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/navigator/BUILD.gn, chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn, chrome/browser/ui/webui/chrome_web_ui_configs.cc
Aerie-Kind: hook

Prototype for issue 72, option 2. Not in patches/series. The helper builds as part of the navigator impl target, because browser_navigator.cc calls it and it needs the tab strip (a separate target would be a dependency cycle).

